# verbs.pdl - which rpg-edit-core verbs are event pages (BOOK 16.game/EVENT-VERB-PAGES-DESIGN.md, PETSLIKE-FRAMEWORK-PLAN.md). Read by &.widgits/events-hq/ops/+x/verbgen.+x
#   verbgen check .   engine source (this game file + the shared core) <-> this file <-> events/ must agree
#   verbgen gen .     write events/<verb>/ for every page=yes verb (never overwrites an edited package)
# page: yes = the window calls "rpg_edit_core.+x fire <verb> [args]" (the shared core), which plays events/<verb>/ and falls back to the plain verb; native = the verb plays its own event pages (play, stop, int);
#       no = engine-internal, read-only, UI state or high frequency (a page run is a sh+bash+prisc launch: never per tick)
GAME | rpg-edit-core | rpg_edit_core_verb | ops/+x/rpg_edit_core.+x | ops/rpg_edit_core.c,../../&.widgits/_shared-lib/petslike_core.c
VERB | buy       | yes    | ui     | item key      | buy a shop item with coins
VERB | control   | yes    | ui     | pet id        | take control of a character
VERB | delpal    | yes    | ui     | -             | remove the last pal
VERB | goto      | yes    | ui     | room          | travel to a room
VERB | load      | yes    | ui     | slot          | load the game from a slot
VERB | newgame   | yes    | ui     | -             | start a fresh game (the current one is kept in slot 0)
VERB | newpal    | yes    | ui     | name          | add a pal to the party (Pals menu)
VERB | newroom   | yes    | ui     | -             | add a room (Rooms menu)
VERB | place     | yes    | ui     | item x y      | place a furniture item
VERB | remove    | yes    | ui     | -             | remove a placed item
VERB | save      | yes    | ui     | slot          | save the game to a slot
VERB | use       | yes    | ui     | hotbar key    | use the item in a hotbar slot
VERB | int       | native | ui     | -             | INT mode on/off (plays events/int_on, int_off)
VERB | play      | native | ui     | -             | start the world (plays events/play)
VERB | stop      | native | ui     | -             | stop the world (plays events/stop)
VERB | clearchat | no     | ui     | -             | wipe the chat
VERB | clock     | no     | ui     | -             | clock rate / advance / start / stop
VERB | day_tick  | no     | ui     | -             | engine: one day passes (event runner)
VERB | export3d   | no     | ui     | -             | engine: export the rooms as the pc-hq book
VERB | mode      | no     | ui     | -             | engine: turn mode
VERB | pet_says  | no     | ui     | -             | a character says a line (event command)
VERB | phase     | no     | ui     | -             | engine: day phase event
VERB | reset     | no     | ui     | -             | reset the game state (destructive; direct on purpose)
VERB | select    | no     | ui     | -             | UI state: select a pet
VERB | status    | no     | ui     | -             | read-only
VERB | step      | no     | ui     | -             | one tick (high frequency)
VERB | sync      | no     | ui     | -             | engine: re-render
VERB | toggle    | no     | ui     | -             | UI state: chat / hb / voice / left panels
VERB | view      | no     | ui     | -             | UI state: 2d / 3d / glyph
VERB | walk      | no     | ui     | -             | one pet step (test)
